            </note>
            <note corresp="#d460-f3" n="30" xml:id="d460-f3-content">
                <p>Pierre Laval, French Minister of Colonies.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d460-f4" n="30a" xml:id="d460-f4-content">
                <p>See <ref target="frus1931v01#pg_33">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1931, vol. <hi
